            "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\">\n                    <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"36\">KNOWLEDGE CHECK</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"115\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"24\">The brutal edit, by the numbers</text>\n                    <rect x=\"100\" y=\"200\" width=\"900\" height=\"200\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.12)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"260\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#6366f1\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">THE 25% RULE</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"310\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">First draft: 2,200 words</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"350\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Final target: ~1,650 words</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"385\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"20\">Roughly a quarter gone</text>\n                    <rect x=\"100\" y=\"430\" width=\"900\" height=\"240\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.12)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"490\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">THE PRIMARY TEST</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"540\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">For every sentence ask:</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"585\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">\"Does this advance the central idea?\"</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"635\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"20\">If no, cut it. No exceptions.</text>\n                    <rect x=\"100\" y=\"700\" width=\"900\" height=\"260\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"755\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"24\">KILL YOUR DARLINGS</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"805\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">The lines you love most</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"845\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">are often the ones you must cut.</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"895\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"20\">The audience never misses</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"930\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"20\">what they never heard.</text>\n                </svg>",
            "caption": "Cut to advance the idea"
