" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.12)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"720\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">HANS ROSLING</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"770\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Master of making data human</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"810\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Abstract → urgent sensory experience</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"855\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"20\">2006 \"Best Stats You've Ever Seen\"</text>\n                    <rect x=\"80\" y=\"900\" width=\"940\" height=\"60\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"945\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">Watch each 3 times. Steal ONE move per speaker.</text>\n                </svg>",
            "caption": "Studying = noticing new moves"
