          "type": "quiz",
          "question": "After studying public speaking for six months and recording yourself weekly, you're now visibly more confident, your pauses land, your structure is tight, and audiences engage. But you haven't actually DELIVERED a single high-stakes speech to a real audience yet. According to the four stages of mastery framework, what's the most likely gap?",
